                    "id": "Q9D818"
                  }
                ],
                "value": "Localized at the apical cortical region during the M phase. In horizontally retinal progenitor dividing cells, localized at the pole cortical region from prophase to telophase cells. In vertically retinal progenitor dividing cells, not detected at the pole cortical region at any stage of mitosis"
